      "statement": "The dashboard router is loaded lazily via openswe/dashboard/__init__.py (PEP 562 __getattr__) so importing a dashboard submodule from middleware does not import routes.py and the full FastAPI/API/job surface; only the webapp that mounts the router pays that cost.",
