        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_337d59c264a24b0fb309d75da0043c83",
      "statement": "The sandbox backend cache is in process and keyed by thread_id while thread metadata persists sandbox_id across processes, so a recycled worker reconnects the same sandbox; an existing sandbox that cannot be reached raises rather than being replaced, because an empty replacement would destroy uncommitted work.",
